1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,776
French lawmakers have approved a national ban on social media accounts for children under 15, making France the first EU country to pass such a broad rule.

2
00:00:11,726 --> 00:00:16,094
AP says the measure also bans mobile phones in high schools.

3
00:00:16,094 --> 00:00:26,961
Supporters argue it protects young people from harmful content, while critics question age checks, privacy and whether the rule can be enforced.

